    <h1 class="page-hero-title">The 7-Year <em>Workmanship Warranty.</em></h1>
    <p class="page-hero-body">Seven years of coverage on every WORKS by JD project. Not one year, like most contractors offer. Seven. Because we build work we're proud to put our name on — for a long time.</p>
