          <li class="include-item"><span class="include-check">✓</span><span>Window and door installation</span></li>
          <li class="include-item"><span class="include-check">✓</span><span>Exterior construction and cladding</span></li>
          <li class="include-item"><span class="include-check">✓</span><span>All other WORKS-provided labor</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div style="background:white;border-radius:var(--r-2xl);padding:40px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);border-top:4px solid var(--forge-400);margin-bottom:24px;">
          <div style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-heading);margin-bottom:16px;">Not Covered by WORKS</div>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--color-body);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:16px;">These items are not covered by the WORKS workmanship warranty — but they're either covered by manufacturer warranties or fall outside of construction liability:</p>
          <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:10px;">
            <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--color-body);"><span style="color:var(--forge-400);font-weight:700;">—</span> Product and material manufacturer defects <em>(covered by manufacturer warranty, registered by WORKS)</em></li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--color-body);"><span style="color:var(--forge-400);font-weight:700;">—</span> Damage caused by homeowner negligence or misuse</li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--color-body);"><span style="color:var(--forge-400);font-weight:700;">—</span> Natural disaster, flooding, fire, or acts of God</li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--color-body);"><span style="color:var(--forge-400);font-weight:700;">—</span> Modifications made to completed work by others</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--ember-50);border-radius:var(--r-2xl);padding:28px;border-left:4px solid var(--ember-500);">
          <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ember-700);margin-bottom:8px;">Manufacturer Warranty Note</div>
          <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--ember-800);line-height:1.7;">WORKS registers all product manufacturer warranties at project close and manages them on your behalf. If a product fails — a Brizo faucet, a Kohler tub, a Marvin window — we coordinate the warranty claim with the manufacturer, at no cost to you.</p>
